      "title": {
        "en": "Founding doctor and attentive team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr. Andrew Lee and Dr. Simpson for thorough clinical evaluations and genuine warmth toward companion animals. Reviewers highlight support technicians and reception staff who greet visitors promptly, creating a supportive and welcoming environment throughout each visit."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle pacing and stress-free handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight that veterinarians and assistants handle nervous pets with extraordinary patience and care. Reviewers note that cats are escorted straight into private rooms to prevent lobby stress, and staff adapt procedures gently to keep frightened animals calm and secure."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Fair fee schedule and private ownership"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently commend the clinic's transparent and reasonable pricing structure, noting exam fees and medication costs that compare favorably to corporate practices across Chicago. Pet owners appreciate the absence of unexpected charges and value the transparency of an independent neighborhood veterinary hospital."
      }
    }
