        "en": "How does the clinic handle nervous or anxious pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight that staff bring nervous cats directly into examination rooms to avoid waiting area stress and use patient, gentle handling during procedures."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is Ivy Veterinary Care independently owned?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the clinic is an independent, minority-owned veterinary practice founded by Dr. Andrew Lee in Chicago's Irving Park neighborhood."
      },
